{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2021-10-25 09:21:00', 'title': "SPIRIT AIRLINES SELECTS PRATT & WHITNEY GTF™ ENGINES TO POWER UP TO 150 NEW A320NEO FAMILY AIRCRAFT IN SPIRIT'S FIT FLEET®", 'text': 'MIRAMAR, FLA., OCT. 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 SPIRIT AIRLINES\xa0(NYSE: SAVE),\xa0ANNOUNCED IT HAS SIGNED AN AGREEMENT WITH PRATT & WHITNEY, A RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES BUSINESS (NYSE: RTX), THROUGH ITS AFFILIATE, IAE INTERNATIONAL AERO ENGINES AG ("IAE"), FOR PW1100G-JM ENGINES TO POWER ITS LATEST ORDER OF\xa0NEW AIRBUS A320NEO FAMILY AIRCRAFT.'}